{"id":"3e49539e5d99baea","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cone-avoidance-ce.md","title":"c.e. 上锥回避","display":"thm-cone-avoidance-ce — c.e. 上锥回避","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cone-avoidance-ce","aliases":["20-thm-cone-avoidance-ce"],"display":"thm-cone-avoidance-ce — c.e. 上锥回避","chapter":"7","section":"7.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.4.1；Lemmas 7.4.4–7.4.5","source_printed_pages":[156,157,158],"source_pdf_pages":[190,191,192],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cone-avoidance-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cone-avoidance-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cone-avoidance-ce — c.e. 上锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.4.1；Lemmas 7.4.4–7.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span><span>157</span><span>158</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>190</span><span>191</span><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land C\\not\\le_TA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land C\\not\\le_TA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 枚举。构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>，每阶段按上游定义计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,r\">\\(\\ell,r\\)</span>。选择最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{i,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{i,s}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2i\">\\(x&gt;2i\\)</span> 并且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le i\">\\(e\\le i\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge r(e,s)\">\\(x\\ge r(e,s)\\)</span>；枚举最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，若无则不动。每个正要求只行动一次；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个负要求只有较高的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 能损伤，故由保持引理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\\)</span> 及有限稳定限制。</p>\n<p>无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\">\\(W_i\\)</span> 在较高正行动结束、较高限制稳定后必出现足够大的可选元素，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W_i\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,2n]\">\\([0,2n]\\)</span> 内，只可能由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次行动枚举元素，余下至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个空位；因此余集无限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单。此计数明确证明余无限，而不以“枚举元素足够大”直接代替它。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.4.1；Lemmas 7.4.4–7.4.5；印刷页 156, 157, 158；PDF 第 190, 191, 192 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-ce-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading